#: geotimezonemodule.cpp:195
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"System clock was changed due to time zone change OSD, keep short: new time "
"(time zone)"
msgid "Clock changed to %1 (%2)"
msgstr "ሰዓቱ ወደ %1 (%2) ተቀይሯል።"

#: geotimezonemodule.cpp:210
#, kde-format
msgid "Refresh is already in progress."
msgstr "ማደስ አስቀድሞ በሂደት ላይ ነው።"

#: geotimezonemodule.cpp:273
#, kde-format
msgid "Received no or an invalid time zone."
msgstr "ምንም የሰዓት ሰቅ አልተቀበለም ወይም የተሳሳተ የሰዓት ሰቅ ተቀብሏል።"
